# Content · FULL Dynamic · Isolated · ALL Pages (LOCKED)

**User memory:** **ALL pages + ALL sections** — content/commerce **FULL dynamic**, **`store_id` isolated**, fake/dummy **banned**.

## Absolute
- Lists + merchant fields (products, orders, customers, invoices, pages, theme text, SEO, blog, marketing) load/save for **that `store_id` only** via real API/DB (or genuine empty).
- Store A ≠ Store B. Never borrow another tenant’s copy/images/SEO/theme/invoices.
- Empty → Waiting for Data / No records — never fake or cross-tenant decorate.

## Two layers (every page)
1. **Chrome** — shared labels/headers/buttons — AR/EN via `isAr` / `t()`
2. **Store ka apna** — merchant data for active `store_id` only

## Do not
- Hardcode merchant body into chrome blobs
- Seed Store B from flowers/coffee/bleco demo packs
- Treat `mockData` / `INITIAL_*` as live production truth
